 # Working notes: e250cb77a62e
 
-Record design decisions, hypotheses, review findings, and unresolved questions here.
-Imported associated notes retain original evidence/timestamps in `evidence/associated_notes.jsonl`.
+## 2026-10-25 native parametric build
+
+Built `workspace/parametric/adapter.py` with one episode-fixed parameter,
+`pattern_transform`:
+
+- `as_drawn` returns the exact selected canonical Racket source unchanged.
+- `quarter_turn` extracts the same input-dependent yellow exemplar from the blue
+  frame, rotates its offsets clockwise using the recovered frame-interior
+  height, and stamps the transformed exemplar at every orange seed.
+
+The shared grammar requires one complete blue frame, a connected yellow
+exemplar anchored at and spanning the frame interior, and one to four disjoint
+seed footprints that fit both settings.  Inputs are sampled independently of the
+private setting.  The family supports 2--6 stable-prefix demonstrations and
+1--4 stable-prefix queries.  Query four is exactly 30x30, contains a 32-cell
+exemplar and three seed footprints, and exercises distinct right-edge and
+bottom-edge behavior under the two transforms.
+
+The declared 15-policy audit found no query-changing survivor across 128 seeds,
+both settings, and every demonstration count from two through six.  The staged
+suite initially exposed a real portability defect in the pre-existing canonical
+fixture test: fixed `__file__.parents[...]` depth pointed beneath the staged
+runtime.  The test now uses `reviewer_support.find_root` and `canonical_pairs`;
+the complete isolated suite then passed.
+
+Protected-Racket native qualification passed at 2, 3, and 6 demonstrations.  In
+the retained qualified witness, step A recovers an eight-cell exemplar and its
+frame dimensions; step B rotates those offsets.  Substituting the unrotated
+offsets changes 30 output cells.
+
+Limits: finite declared rivals and bounded seeds do not prove universal
+identifiability or training value.  The prototype is reviewer-ready only;
+owner exact-source qualification/acceptance and any training-admission decision
+remain separate.
